    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "intentional steps? i dont think i even have the energy for that. it just feels like i'm taking up space that i don't belong in. like if i just stopped existing tomorrow, the city wouldn't even skip a beat. everything would just stay exactly the same. it's like i'm not even a part of the world.",
