      "content": "It's a very tempting thought to just let the weight lift by stopping the effort, but that feeling of emptiness is a deep ache, not a permanent state. Trying to \"be seen\" feels exhausting right now, so maybe the goal isn't to be seen by everyone, but simply to be kinder to yourself in this moment. You don't have to fix the whole world; just breathe through the next five minutes.",
